WEBVTT

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:19.320
A light so bright that it can't be hidden
Breaks the silence and resurrects in this world

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:30.070
The dry land quakes violently
Sparks clash as we risk our lives

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:37.790
Let a miracle occur, just one more time

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:44.950
The power to regain the pages of memories I lost long ago

00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:53.020
The trusting heart pierces the darkness
Search for the place where the soul rests

00:00:53.150 --> 00:00:59.250
The sharp glint in my unblinking eye burns

00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:06.700
Two souls - light and shadow
To the future shown in the crystal

00:01:06.890 --> 00:01:13.310
Now moving  Overflowing in red  eyes

00:01:28.700 --> 00:01:34.480
The ultimate Shadow Game against Bakura in the world of my lost memories.

00:01:34.480 --> 00:01:39.980
Bakura defeated Mahad and acquired the Millennium Ring, strengthening his evil powers.

00:01:39.980 --> 00:01:42.640
He attacks the palace again.

00:01:42.640 --> 00:01:45.450
Who's your next target?

00:01:45.450 --> 00:01:51.100
And who's the blue-eyed girl that Seto rescued?

00:01:51.860 --> 00:01:57.880
Secret of the Millennium Items' Creation

00:02:05.840 --> 00:02:10.900
Since I have the evil of the Millennium Ring, my power is infinite.

00:02:11.540 --> 00:02:14.130
You defeated Mahad?

00:02:14.130 --> 00:02:20.220
Someone who slaughtered many people in Kul Elna cares about his friend's death?

00:02:20.220 --> 00:02:22.660
How do you know about that?

00:02:23.380 --> 00:02:26.820
Because I’m from Kul Elna!

00:02:27.760 --> 00:02:32.720
But that doesn’t matter because this is a Shadow Game.

00:02:32.720 --> 00:02:35.200
It doesn’t concern the current me.

00:02:36.530 --> 00:02:38.200
What do you mean?

00:02:39.050 --> 00:02:45.060
You'll serve me, just like you did 3,000 years ago.

00:02:45.060 --> 00:02:49.100
By putting this item's evil into your Millennium Eye.

00:02:50.330 --> 00:02:54.520
Fulfill your 3,000 year-old goal!

00:03:01.900 --> 00:03:06.560
My Millennium Puzzle senses a threat.

00:03:07.000 --> 00:03:08.330
Pharaoh!

00:03:08.330 --> 00:03:09.210
What is it?

00:03:09.210 --> 00:03:13.410
A village down the river was attacked and destroyed!

00:03:13.410 --> 00:03:14.570
What?

00:03:17.340 --> 00:03:18.810
What's that?

00:03:18.810 --> 00:03:19.780
What’s going on?

00:03:21.690 --> 00:03:23.150
What was that sound?

00:03:28.090 --> 00:03:30.960
That's Bakura!

00:03:31.420 --> 00:03:33.320
Bakura’s here!

00:03:33.320 --> 00:03:36.900
He's hiding somewhere in the palace!  Find him!

00:03:36.900 --> 00:03:40.000
Have the soldiers outside surround the palace!

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:41.530
Don’t let him escape!

00:03:49.940 --> 00:03:51.730
This is horrible!

00:03:51.730 --> 00:03:54.420
Aknadin, hang in there!

00:03:54.420 --> 00:03:56.420
Aknadin!

00:03:56.420 --> 00:03:57.620
Aknadin!

00:03:58.040 --> 00:04:00.620
Seto...

00:04:01.550 --> 00:04:03.450
Aknadin!

00:04:03.980 --> 00:04:05.490
He's unconscious.

00:04:06.090 --> 00:04:08.860
Bakura tried to steal his Millennium Eye.

00:04:08.860 --> 00:04:10.410
How dare he!

00:04:10.410 --> 00:04:12.800
Shada, look after Aknadin.

00:04:13.720 --> 00:04:16.600
Karim!  We’re going after Bakura!

00:04:16.600 --> 00:04:17.440
Right!

00:04:17.440 --> 00:04:19.240
Stop!

00:04:19.640 --> 00:04:21.440
Don’t let him escape!

00:04:24.310 --> 00:04:25.980
Don’t let him through!

00:04:27.140 --> 00:04:29.120
Stop!

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:35.550
If you come near me, Diabound will end you!

00:04:40.760 --> 00:04:43.480
So the Pharaoh wants to join!

00:04:46.260 --> 00:04:48.290
I won’t let you escape, Bakura!

00:04:48.290 --> 00:04:50.820
I summon a God!  Come forth!

00:04:56.010 --> 00:04:59.020
Slifer the Sky Dragon!

00:05:01.820 --> 00:05:04.380
The second God has emerged.

00:05:04.380 --> 00:05:06.600
Slifer the Sky Dragon!

00:05:06.600 --> 00:05:08.750
Fine, Pharaoh!

00:05:08.750 --> 00:05:11.850
The second act of our battle begins!

00:05:11.850 --> 00:05:14.190
Follow me to the depths of hell!

00:05:14.190 --> 00:05:18.940
Bakura!  I won't let you spill innocent blood anymore!

00:05:18.940 --> 00:05:20.730
Bakura is coming!

00:05:20.730 --> 00:05:21.610
Don’t let him escape!

00:05:21.610 --> 00:05:23.040
Guard the gate!

00:05:33.050 --> 00:05:34.590
My other self!

00:05:34.590 --> 00:05:36.520
Hey, Yugi!

00:05:38.450 --> 00:05:43.000
He was wearing weird clothes, but that was definitely Yugi!

00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:46.060
And Bakura was in front of him!

00:05:46.060 --> 00:05:47.390
Yugi...

00:05:47.390 --> 00:05:49.980
Everyone, let’s go!

00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:04.670
I know everything.

00:06:04.670 --> 00:06:07.440
I know what you did at Kul Elna.

00:06:07.440 --> 00:06:11.780
And how you abandoned your son - Seto.

00:06:11.780 --> 00:06:14.800
Yes...  15 years ago...

00:06:30.060 --> 00:06:32.460
Pharaoh Aknamkanon, here's my report:

00:06:32.470 --> 00:06:36.110
The enemy's invasion hasn't let up.

00:06:36.110 --> 00:06:38.890
They're breaking through our defenses.

00:06:38.890 --> 00:06:42.400
How long can our army survive?

00:06:42.400 --> 00:06:45.390
Seven days maximum.

00:06:46.860 --> 00:06:48.840
So this is the end.

00:06:49.310 --> 00:06:52.720
Pharaoh Aknamkanon, you must not give up.

00:06:52.720 --> 00:06:57.790
We're not just fighting for our nation, but for the future of the continent.

00:06:57.790 --> 00:07:03.700
Our enemy wants to steal our legendary Millennium Spellbook.

00:07:03.700 --> 00:07:05.740
Millennium Spellbook.

00:07:06.280 --> 00:07:15.180
Whoever unlocks its spells will control the gods, monsters and armies.

00:07:15.180 --> 00:07:19.840
If that Spellbook falls into enemy hands, they'll conquer the entire land.

00:07:19.840 --> 00:07:25.130
But we have yet to unlock the Spellbook's spells.

00:07:25.770 --> 00:07:29.060
Actually, we have decoded some of it.

00:07:29.060 --> 00:07:33.010
What?  Is that true, Akanadin?

00:07:33.010 --> 00:07:37.690
Yes.  It deals with dark alchemy.

00:07:37.690 --> 00:07:43.050
A method to use magic to create seven treasures with mysterious power.

00:07:43.050 --> 00:07:50.420
If we can create them, we will defeat the invaders and restore peace in Egypt.

00:07:50.420 --> 00:07:53.620
The seven treasures will bring peace...

00:07:53.970 --> 00:07:57.490
It'll take seven days to create them.

00:07:57.490 --> 00:08:03.800
I've already begun preparations to conduct this dark alchemy.

00:08:04.560 --> 00:08:06.810
Dark alchemy...

00:08:08.860 --> 00:08:10.230
We have no choice.

00:08:10.700 --> 00:08:15.360
I entrust the future and peace of the kingdom to those seven treasures.

00:08:15.360 --> 00:08:17.310
I’m counting on you, Aknadin.

00:08:17.310 --> 00:08:19.410
My younger brother!

00:08:21.880 --> 00:08:23.320
I’m sorry.

00:08:23.320 --> 00:08:29.220
To save the kingdom, I must keep secret what I'm about to do forever.

00:08:29.220 --> 00:08:33.450
And abandon the fact that I'm the Pharaoh’s brother.

00:08:33.450 --> 00:08:38.330
You and Seto must forget your past.  And forget me.

00:08:38.330 --> 00:08:41.340
And live somewhere far away.

00:08:41.610 --> 00:08:42.760
But dear...

00:08:42.760 --> 00:08:49.580
Tell Seto that his father was an ordinary soldier that died in battle.

00:08:50.720 --> 00:08:52.280
My dear!

00:08:52.570 --> 00:08:54.650
Farewell, my wife.

00:08:54.650 --> 00:08:57.080
And Seto.

00:09:03.290 --> 00:09:07.900
You are the kingdom’s elite!

00:09:07.900 --> 00:09:11.960
Your actions will determine the future of our nation!

00:09:11.960 --> 00:09:20.690
Look into our eyes to see what you must do for a glorious future!

00:09:30.300 --> 00:09:33.130
Listen with your heart.

00:09:33.130 --> 00:09:35.560
My voice is the voice of the heavens.

00:09:35.980 --> 00:09:38.560
The voice of destiny.

00:09:38.560 --> 00:09:42.080
You must obey my voice.

00:09:42.080 --> 00:09:47.860
We're going to Kul Elna, a village near the Valley of the Kings.

00:09:47.860 --> 00:09:52.960
Don't mention a word of this to anyone we meet along the way!

00:09:52.960 --> 00:09:54.410
Let us depart!

00:10:01.740 --> 00:10:09.320
To perform the ritual, dark alchemy requires many human sacrifices.

00:10:09.320 --> 00:10:12.820
I must do it to protect the kingdom, but it is inhuman.

00:10:12.820 --> 00:10:16.900
So I cannot tell the Pharaoh.

00:10:16.900 --> 00:10:18.630
Forgive me, brother.

00:10:24.090 --> 00:10:27.250
That's Kul Elna Village!

00:10:27.250 --> 00:10:32.180
A village of bandits that raids the royal tombs!

00:10:32.180 --> 00:10:37.280
Our kingdom is in peril is because their actions have angered the gods!

00:10:37.280 --> 00:10:40.600
We will judge them and make them pay for their crimes!

00:10:40.600 --> 00:10:42.120
Don’t let anyone escape!

00:10:52.660 --> 00:10:54.940
Save me!

00:11:23.370 --> 00:11:27.820
Dark alchemy is a ritual between god and the devil.

00:11:27.820 --> 00:11:36.890
The seven Millennium Items were created by sacrificing Kul Elna's villagers and our soldiers.

00:11:41.130 --> 00:11:42.980
But then...

00:11:44.500 --> 00:11:46.300
What?

00:11:53.570 --> 00:11:59.940
We didn’t know that the seven treasures actually served a horrifying function.

00:12:01.370 --> 00:12:05.540
Or why the tablet had indentations for the seven treasures.

00:12:13.130 --> 00:12:15.000
Swen!  Sekem!

00:12:45.770 --> 00:12:49.810
Insert the remaining treasures.

00:13:00.760 --> 00:13:03.780
Fiend!  Leave!

00:13:09.280 --> 00:13:10.700
Aknadin!

00:13:16.500 --> 00:13:18.140
Now’s our chance, Swen!

00:13:18.140 --> 00:13:19.000
Right!

00:13:30.820 --> 00:13:31.800
Swen!

00:13:31.800 --> 00:13:33.920
Get up, Swen!

00:13:33.920 --> 00:13:38.130
Don’t worry about me.  Take the seven treasures.

00:13:38.680 --> 00:13:42.090
The fewer who know its secrets, the better.

00:13:43.320 --> 00:13:44.680
Swen!

00:13:46.220 --> 00:13:47.690
Swen...

00:14:01.810 --> 00:14:04.360
I made it home.

00:14:05.140 --> 00:14:07.360
With the Millennium Items.

00:14:17.680 --> 00:14:21.920
They have no soldiers to protect the castle!

00:14:21.920 --> 00:14:24.120
This kingdom is ours!

00:14:36.820 --> 00:14:38.850
What a joke!

00:14:38.850 --> 00:14:40.990
What can only seven people do?

00:14:45.360 --> 00:14:50.130
The seven treasures, protect my kingdom and its people!

00:14:51.970 --> 00:14:55.660
Spirits!  Lend us your power!

00:15:06.120 --> 00:15:08.720
The kingdom was saved.

00:15:12.560 --> 00:15:18.460
As per Pharaoh Aknamkanon’s wishes, I hid my identity and remained in the palace.

00:15:18.460 --> 00:15:23.570
I had no regrets for offering my life to the kingdom, except for one.

00:15:24.420 --> 00:15:29.740
Seto, I gave you no future.

00:15:30.810 --> 00:15:36.290
This is Priest Seto, the new owner of the Millennium Rod.

00:15:36.290 --> 00:15:42.290
Though he lost his parents at an early age, he passed the difficult tests at the top of his class.

00:15:42.290 --> 00:15:45.600
A talent that only appears once a decade.

00:15:45.600 --> 00:15:48.100
Lift your head, Seto.

00:15:49.450 --> 00:15:56.900
As the new owner of the Millennium Rod, I will further devote myself to the kingdom.

00:15:57.410 --> 00:15:59.460
I'm counting on you, Seto.

00:15:59.460 --> 00:16:03.080
You'll be my son’s right-hand man one day.

00:16:03.540 --> 00:16:05.240
Thank you for those words.

00:16:06.340 --> 00:16:09.180
Is something wrong, Aknadin?

00:16:09.180 --> 00:16:15.680
Seto, you can’t imagine the joy I felt.

00:16:15.680 --> 00:16:23.860
The son I abandoned overcame his adversities to claw his way to the top.

00:16:23.860 --> 00:16:26.840
Seto, this is your destiny.

00:16:26.840 --> 00:16:28.810
There's a secret bloodline.

00:16:28.810 --> 00:16:30.560
The one who should be Pharaoh...

00:16:36.980 --> 00:16:38.940
...is you, Seto!

00:16:46.020 --> 00:16:47.690
This spot is fine.

00:16:47.690 --> 00:16:52.200
Diabound, greet him with your new ability!

00:16:52.200 --> 00:16:54.270
Go, Magical Shockwave!

00:16:59.260 --> 00:17:02.860
When Diabound defeats a foe, it steals its abilities.

00:17:02.860 --> 00:17:05.740
That one was Mahad's.

00:17:05.740 --> 00:17:07.540
Mahad...

00:17:07.540 --> 00:17:10.920
Slifer!  Lightning Bullet!

00:17:12.980 --> 00:17:13.930
What?

00:17:17.180 --> 00:17:19.000
Keep riding!

00:17:19.000 --> 00:17:21.640
The death fuse is coming close!

00:17:24.120 --> 00:17:24.820
Die!

00:17:32.970 --> 00:17:34.860
That hurt!

00:17:34.860 --> 00:17:37.890
Keep the pressure on, Slifer!

00:17:37.890 --> 00:17:43.940
You forgot that this location is favorable for me!

00:17:43.940 --> 00:17:48.520
Diabound, destroy everything around you!

00:17:53.280 --> 00:17:55.310
There's a monster in the sky!

00:17:55.310 --> 00:17:58.380
Monster?  I don’t see anything.

00:17:59.520 --> 00:18:00.500
What?

00:18:02.240 --> 00:18:05.490
Villagers, make way for the Pharaoh!

00:18:08.820 --> 00:18:11.610
He's making them collateral damage!

00:18:11.610 --> 00:18:14.720
Pharaoh, this is a game!

00:18:14.720 --> 00:18:18.140
How many innocent people can you save?

00:18:35.480 --> 00:18:40.190
You'll shield everyone and take all the attacks?

00:18:40.190 --> 00:18:44.350
How long can you last, Pharaoh?

00:18:52.120 --> 00:18:54.360
I won't let you flee.

00:18:54.360 --> 00:18:57.640
If you do, the villagers will be attacked.

00:18:58.880 --> 00:19:03.330
Bakura!  My god won’t lose to your dirty tricks!

00:19:03.330 --> 00:19:05.770
Take this!  Thunder Force!

00:19:05.770 --> 00:19:06.860
Helical Shockwave!

00:19:12.580 --> 00:19:14.000
That’s...

00:19:18.100 --> 00:19:19.260
What?

00:19:19.260 --> 00:19:23.020
I won't let you endanger the city!

00:19:23.020 --> 00:19:26.100
Slifer, fight in the skies!

00:19:28.170 --> 00:19:30.880
Your attacks won’t reach the city!

00:19:30.880 --> 00:19:34.120
A Sky Dragon fights better in the sky.

00:19:34.120 --> 00:19:39.910
But if Slifer controls the heavens, my Diabound controls the shadows!

00:19:42.080 --> 00:19:43.260
It vanished!

00:19:45.120 --> 00:19:49.710
Diabound can merge with its surroundings to hide itself.

00:19:49.710 --> 00:19:53.700
Pharaoh, I've increased the game's difficulty.

00:19:58.980 --> 00:20:02.750
I have other tricks up my sleeve, but I don’t need to use them.

00:20:02.750 --> 00:20:06.390
I have many options.

00:20:06.390 --> 00:20:09.680
Should I destroy the city right before your eyes?

00:20:09.680 --> 00:20:12.620
Or should I just kill you now?

00:20:12.620 --> 00:20:17.570
Actually, I want you to give me your Millennium Puzzle.

00:20:17.570 --> 00:20:24.760
I want the embodiment of the gods to vow to serve me right here.

00:20:24.760 --> 00:20:29.580
If I give him my Millennium Puzzle, I'll definitely lose.

00:20:29.580 --> 00:20:32.800
But I can't let any more people die.

00:20:34.110 --> 00:20:36.650
You're giving it to me?

00:20:36.650 --> 00:20:39.650
But I still have a chance to turn this around.

00:20:39.650 --> 00:20:45.160
There's one way to bring Diabound out of the shadows.

00:20:45.160 --> 00:20:50.450
Get off your horse and kneel before me, Pharaoh!

00:20:50.450 --> 00:20:52.390
Now, Slifer!

00:20:57.980 --> 00:21:02.710
You have to call Diabound back to protect yourself!

00:21:11.490 --> 00:21:14.520
I never said Diabound was hiding in the sky.

00:21:16.210 --> 00:21:20.160
I’ve decided to kill you.

00:21:20.790 --> 00:21:25.330
Spend eternity in the world between life and death!

00:21:29.400 --> 00:21:30.500
That’s...

00:21:31.110 --> 00:21:33.430
It’s Seto’s spirit, Duos!

00:21:34.370 --> 00:21:36.450
Pharaoh!

00:21:38.500 --> 00:21:39.670
Seto!

00:21:58.270 --> 00:22:12.890
Right now, we don't need a map

00:22:13.050 --> 00:22:28.610
The miracle that tore through the darkness is in my hand

00:22:29.330 --> 00:22:34.450
Without a goal in mind

00:22:35.770 --> 00:22:43.020
We just step towards our dream

00:22:43.410 --> 00:22:48.660
EYE'S  As you sense it

00:22:48.850 --> 00:22:57.130
Your eye will find it

00:22:57.490 --> 00:23:02.940
Oh! EYE'S  What you wish for

00:23:03.730 --> 00:23:11.080
Will touch your soul

00:23:11.270 --> 00:23:14.340
In a duel

00:23:26.560 --> 00:23:30.560
Unable to enter the palace, we're at a loss....

00:23:30.560 --> 00:23:33.350
...when Slifer the Sky Dragon flew!

00:23:33.350 --> 00:23:37.290
The other Yugi is controlling it!

00:23:37.290 --> 00:23:42.090
Yugi is defending the city against Bakura's Diabound's attacks.

00:23:42.090 --> 00:23:44.770
We have to help him!

00:23:44.770 --> 00:23:47.600
Stand up, Yugi!  We're with you!

00:23:47.600 --> 00:23:50.440
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Time Rewinds

00:23:50.440 --> 00:23:51.750
Stay tuned!
